./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:1208:- OpenCode/onboarding: add new OpenCode Go provider, treat Zen and Go as one OpenCode setup in the wizard/docs while keeping the runtime providers split, store one shared OpenCode key for both profiles, and stop overriding the built-in `opencode-go` catalog routing. (#42313) Thanks @ImLukeF and @vincentkoc.
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:4883:- Auth: normalize Claude Code CLI profile mode to oauth and auto-migrate config. (#855) - thanks @sebslight.
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:4898:- Auth: label Claude Code CLI auth options. (#915) - thanks @SeanZoR.
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:4899:- Docs: standardize Claude Code CLI naming across docs and prompts. (follow-up to #915)
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:5035:- CLI/Onboarding: prompt to reuse detected API keys for Moonshot/MiniMax/Z.AI/Gemini/Anthropic/OpenCode.
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:5128:- Agents/OpenCode Zen: update fallback models + defaults, keep legacy alias mappings. (#669) - thanks @magimetal.
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:5175:- Auth: update Claude Code keychain credentials in-place during refresh sync; share JSON file helpers; add CLI fallback coverage.
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:5214:- Models/Auth expansion: OpenCode Zen + MiniMax API onboarding; token auth profiles + auth order; OAuth health in doctor/status.
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:5222:- Models/Auth: OpenCode Zen onboarding (#623) - thanks @magimetal; MiniMax Anthropic-compatible API + hosted onboarding (#590, #495) - thanks @mneves75, @tobiasbischoff.
./references/git_search/openclaw-main/CHANGELOG.md:5272:- Auth: enable OAuth token refresh for Claude Code CLI credentials (`anthropic:claude-cli`) with bidirectional sync back to Claude Code storage (file on Linux/Windows, Keychain on macOS). This allows long-running agents to operate autonomously without manual re-authentication (#654 - thanks @radek-paclt).
